What is O2Adaptor and why it exists

O2Adaptor is a Spring Boot microservice inside SMO (Service Management & Orchestration).
Its main responsibility is to act as a bridge between O-Cloud (infrastructure world) and SMO / Kafka-based systems.

In simple words:

O2Adaptor listens to O-Cloud / Simulator notifications, converts them into standard inventory events, and publishes them to Kafka so downstream systems (SO, AAI, RAN Importer) can consume them.

2. High-level system flow (business view)
O-Cloud / Simulator
        |
        |  Notification (HTTP)
        v
   O2Adaptor
        |
        |  Inventory Events
        v
      Kafka
        |
        v
 SO / RAN Importer / AAI


O2Adaptor is NOT a UI service, it is an integration & event translation service.

